<P>The ballet-piece <STRONG>Ma Donna</STRONG> deals with <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s life and&nbsp;it's based on her music, with <STRONG>"Mother and Father"</STRONG> being a very important part of the performance, as this song&nbsp;shows <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>’s deep relationship&nbsp;with her too soon passed away mother as well as&nbsp;the difficult relationship&nbsp;with her father, who married again.</P>
<P>It's staged at:<BR><BR><STRONG>Termine</STRONG><BR>04.03.2005 20:00 Uhr - Stadttheater Flensburg<BR>15.04.2005 20:00 Uhr - Theater in der Stadthalle<BR><A href="http://www.sh-landestheater.de/" target=_blank>http://www.sh-landestheater.de/</A> </P>
