	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P><IMG src="/claudine.jpg" border=0></P>
<P><STRONG>AN INTERVIEW WITH MADONNA WAS AIRED TODAY AT 1:05 AM (IN THE NIGHT) ON TF1 IN VOL DE NUIT PRESENTED BY PATRICK POIVRE D'ARVOR</STRONG>.</P>
<P>She was dressed as in the Richard and Judy show (see picture below). She said she kept her good ideas in her head, in her brain, and then these ideas just come out when she sat in front of her computer and writes.</P>
<P><EM><STRONG>"&nbsp;When people ask you if you are really a writer, what's your answer?"</STRONG></EM></P>
<P><EM><STRONG>"Yes, I've been a writer for years... articles for magazines, poems, songs, letters and now children books..."</STRONG></EM></P>
<P align=center><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/abdifrance.jpg" border=0></P>
<P><STRONG>"Les Aventures d'Adbi"</STRONG> will be <STRONG>out TOMORROW</STRONG> everywhere in <STRONG>FRANCE.</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>This is the interview for the Abdi promotion in France that </STRONG><A href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/"><STRONG>DrownedMadonna</STRONG></A><STRONG> revealed its readers months ago. See </STRONG><A href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/modules.php?name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=5202" target=_blank><STRONG>here</STRONG></A>.</P>
</font></div>
